id: pm-beads-np1y
title: Clarify blocks-only Beads dependency import semantics
description: "The extractBlockerIds docstring claims blocks support, but the released extractor consumes only dependencies and blocked_by. A blocks-only record currently validates without creating its outgoing relationship. Repair packets explicitly mark this representation as an unsupported_blocks gap rather than inferring direction or silently claiming validity. Follow-up: define provider direction and add shared producer/import/validation coverage before changing existing semantics."
